  "description": "Hong Si-won, the greatest chef in Korean history, suddenly passed away. His last will was shocking: all the chefs in his restaurant were to compete for the position of head chef. A young man with a “divine tongue,” Park Geon-woo, is invited to this fierce competition. Can he survive the intense battlefield of “Tae Mi-ok” where no one can be trusted? A heated culinary showdown filled with passion, growth, friendship, and conflict. Who will emerge as the ultimate victor?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
